    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Eeny, meeny, miney, moe</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Creepy GREEN EYES are on the wall.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Don't you think all this is joke,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Little girl is gonna choke!&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150620/extras/76c6c9bcba41c7bd9526e8332c2dfcb1.poster.avif?t=1755172268\" width=600 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150620/extras/76c6c9bcba41c7bd9526e8332c2dfcb1.webm?t=1755172268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150620/extras/76c6c9bcba41c7bd9526e8332c2dfcb1.mp4?t=1755172268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Have you heard the cursed Green Vinyl?\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is a Black Blanket  trying to strangle you in your sleep? Have you ever almost devoured a Blue Finger in a bun? SOVIET SPOOKY TALES: Green Eyes is the first of five visual novels based on real Soviet campfire tales. Step into the shoes of Dasha, a rebellious 4th grader who disobeys her mother and listens to a cursed green vinyl. Confront the mysterious and terrifying evil green eyes. Can you guide Dasha to safety, or will she just become another urban legend?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150620/extras/50173a1c61fe4dba79a61698d3141af8.poster.avif?t=1755172268\" width=600 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150620/extras/50173a1c61fe4dba79a61698d3141af8.webm?t=1755172268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150620/extras/50173a1c61fe4dba79a61698d3141af8.mp4?t=1755172268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Immerse yourself in the Soviet era of 1986 during the &quot;Perestroika,&quot; five years before the fall of the USSR</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Nostalgic and cozy pixel art</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Animated characters and cutscenes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Three endings: CORPSE, COWARD, and COMRADE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Eat a lucky ticket!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf There is a grandma with borscht </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Gameplay time around 3-4 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Experience true soviet childhood!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Eeny, meeny, miney, moe</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Creepy GREEN EYES are on the wall.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Don't you think all this is joke,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Little girl is gonna choke!&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150620/extras/76c6c9bcba41c7bd9526e8332c2dfcb1.poster.avif?t=1755172268\" width=600 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150620/extras/76c6c9bcba41c7bd9526e8332c2dfcb1.webm?t=1755172268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150620/extras/76c6c9bcba41c7bd9526e8332c2dfcb1.mp4?t=1755172268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Have you heard the cursed Green Vinyl?\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is a Black Blanket  trying to strangle you in your sleep? Have you ever almost devoured a Blue Finger in a bun? SOVIET SPOOKY TALES: Green Eyes is the first of five visual novels based on real Soviet campfire tales. Step into the shoes of Dasha, a rebellious 4th grader who disobeys her mother and listens to a cursed green vinyl. Confront the mysterious and terrifying evil green eyes. Can you guide Dasha to safety, or will she just become another urban legend?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150620/extras/50173a1c61fe4dba79a61698d3141af8.poster.avif?t=1755172268\" width=600 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150620/extras/50173a1c61fe4dba79a61698d3141af8.webm?t=1755172268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150620/extras/50173a1c61fe4dba79a61698d3141af8.mp4?t=1755172268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Immerse yourself in the Soviet era of 1986 during the &quot;Perestroika,&quot; five years before the fall of the USSR</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Nostalgic and cozy pixel art</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Animated characters and cutscenes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Three endings: CORPSE, COWARD, and COMRADE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Eat a lucky ticket!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf There is a grandma with borscht </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Gameplay time around 3-4 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Experience true soviet childhood!</p>",
